<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | RO Service Support</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Read our privacy policy to understand how RO Service Support collects, uses, and protects your personal information." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://roservicesupport.co.in/privacy-policy" />
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f7fb; color: #222; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { background: #0A2B4E; padding: 14px 0; }
        .header-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
        .logo span { color: #f97316; }
        .back-link { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .back-link:hover { color: #f97316; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 60px; }
        .page-title { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A2B4E; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2; }
        .page-subtitle { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888; margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: justify; }
        .content-box { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
        .content-box h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A2B4E; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.3; }
        .content-box h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
        .content-box p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .content-box ul { margin: 12px 0 16px 20px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify; }
        .content-box li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
        footer { background: #0A2B4E; color: #94a3b8; padding: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        footer a { color: #f97316; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="header-inner">
            <a href="/" class="logo">RO <span>Service Support</span></a>
            <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: January 2025</p>

        <div class="content-box">
            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                At RO Service Support, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you visit our website or use our services.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We may collect the following personal information when you fill out our service request form or contact us:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Full name</li>
                <li>Mobile number</li>
                <li>Pin code</li>
                <li>Residential address</li>
                <li>Email address (if provided)</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>The information we collect is used only for the following purposes:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>To schedule and provide doorstep RO service</li>
                <li>To contact you regarding your service request</li>
                <li>To send booking confirmations and updates</li>
                <li>To improve our customer support and services</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>
                We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. Your data may be shared only with our authorized technicians or service partners strictly for the purpose of completing your service request.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                Our website may use cookies to improve your browsing experience. You can choose to disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features of the website may not function properly as a result.
            </p>

            <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>
                We may use third-party services such as Google Analytics and Google Ads to understand website traffic and improve our services. These services may collect anonymous usage data as per their own privacy policies.
            </p>

            <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
                You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details below.
            </p>

            <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.
            </p>

            <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
            </p>
            <p>
                Email: <strong>{EMAIL}</strong><br />
                Phone: <strong>+91 70901 70092</strong>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 RO Service Support. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
            <a href="/about">About</a> · 
            <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> · 
            <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · 
            <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> · 
            <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>
        </p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>